        <mxCell id="anchor" value="&lt;b&gt;SOURCE ANCHORING&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;We report a case of&lt;br&gt;[fulminant hepatic failure] associated with [didanosine]&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Adverse-Effect span = [20,45)&lt;br&gt;Drug span = [62,72)&lt;br&gt;Copied text; deterministic offset reconstruction" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=22;fontColor=#17324d;fillColor=#fff7e6;strokeColor=#c9892f;strokeWidth=2;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;rounded=1;arcSize=12;fontStyle=1;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1">
